-- הסכם אופק חדש (25.12.2008), §117 טבלאות השכר המשולב וגמול סגנות: an
-- academic second deputy under the reform is on the academic teachers'
-- tables, with a deputyship allowance of 13% of his combined salary; the
-- State works for its recognition in the pension; contributions on it.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

§ `117 טבלאות השכר המשולב וגמול סגנות`

@ref akn:art_117__para_a
`a second deputy is on the academic teachers' tables` MEANS TRUE

-- (ב): 13% of the combined salary (convention rounding.default).
@ref akn:art_117__para_b
`the deputyship rate` MEANS 13%

GIVEN `combined salary` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the deputyship allowance` `combined salary` IS
    `the deputyship rate` TIMES `combined salary`

DECLARE `section 117 action` IS ONE OF
    `act to have the deputyship allowance recognised as permanent for the pension law`
    `make accrual-pension contributions on the deputyship allowance`
    `make study-fund contributions on the deputyship allowance`

@ref akn:art_117__para_c
GIVEN `insured in an accrual pension` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `section 117 action`
DECIDE `the pension on the deputyship allowance` `insured in an accrual pension` IS
    IF `insured in an accrual pension`
    THEN PARTY `the State` MUST `make accrual-pension contributions on the deputyship allowance`
         LEST BREACH BY `the State` BECAUSE "section 117(ג): accrual-pension contributions on the allowance"
    ELSE PARTY `the State` MUST `act to have the deputyship allowance recognised as permanent for the pension law`
         LEST BREACH BY `the State` BECAUSE "section 117(ג): the State acts for the allowance's recognition"

@ref akn:art_117__para_d
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `section 117 action`
DECIDE `the study fund on the deputyship allowance` IS
    PARTY `the State` MUST `make study-fund contributions on the deputyship allowance`
    LEST BREACH BY `the State` BECAUSE "section 117(ד): study-fund contributions on the allowance"

#ASSERT `the deputyship allowance` 9000 EQUALS 1170
